data: {"delta":"Based on the provided evidence, here are the latest developments from NVIDIA:\n\nOn October 21, 2026, NVIDIA announced that leading global telecom operators are turning their networks into distributed intelligence platforms [1].\n\nOn October 12, 2026, NVIDIA announced new partnerships and contributions aimed at creating a common foundation for next-generation AI infrastructure, including the opening of the Vera Rubin facility [2].\n\nNVIDIA and Meta are expanding their collaboration on Muse and the Muse family of models, reflecting popular demand for AI agents [4].\n\nAdditionally, NVIDIA has announced plans with supply chain partners to expand global manufacturing capacity to meet growing demand for AI infrastructure [5].\n\nJensen Huang, NVIDIA's CEO, is ranked No. 1 on Glassdoor's Best CEOs list for 2026 [6].","conversationId":"cmvyp5vqx00eprmvn2urxikni"}

